    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fragroom by District Zero</h2><br>Fragroom: Defenders is a fast-paced cartoony session PVE (Player-vs-Environment) shooting game with straightforward gameplay. Survive the hordes of zombies keen to destroy your small store-based shelter. Aim, shoot, change position, grab a bonus, repeat. Invite your friends over and let the fun begin.<br><br>The current version includes a list of cool features, such as:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 playable rounds (Tower Defence Mode)<br></li><li>4 customized destructible meshes<br></li><li>6 customized weapons<br></li><li>9 different enemies<br></li><li>Lots of character's skins<br></li><li>In-game voice chat</li></ul>",
